cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the research publication below when referring to the OIBOK research
  baseline. For a Guide, tool, article or editorial supplement, use its own
  title and displayed edition with the citation on that page.
  The preferred citation's licence applies to publication content; website
  software and official marks have separate treatment at oibok.org/licensing/.
title: OIBOK publication website
authors:
  - name: Intent & Effect
repository-code: https://github.com/IntentEffect/OIBOK
url: https://oibok.org/
